one knows that there is something unusual about him. Nevertheless he is liked by everyone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"- Doesn't go to classes sometimes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"- Likes tall places."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"- Works in a florist."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"- Likes the 'natural world', and is a sucker for animals and sweet things (pancakes are his favorite)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"- Lives in a beach shack with his brother, Kouichi."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From 26 Hours and Tokimeki Memorial Girl's Side Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1266"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a355e2f334e494e01f83073937edf26dc36d980e58070ab1467547f510c4821a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aa2f3403175269d272f56226d4c102901a3bd2ec894feebefafbe46f8f993a17.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"杉田 智和","creatorId":"vndb:s370","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s370","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s370","name":"杉田 智和","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21366","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1267","characterName":"桜井 琥一","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1267"},"originalCharacterName":"桜井 琥一","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"519"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"189"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"73"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ruka's older brother. Completely opposite Ruka, Kouichi likes 'tough' vintage things, like motorbikes and 1960's American memorabilia. Ruka and Kouichi both seem to attract fights, and they are both skilled at hand-to-hand combat. Kouichi is a city boy, and likes loud, bright things and hanging around downtown."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Tokimeki Memorial Girl's Side Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1267"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5a7ae9ac73c53607576cd3251793712db33fd26ec7aebb689ce7b87b39ccb9c3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/14/14d53fa48c600ce43271c183b4c15aab812ef63f527b0f7c5f8246fa74c0b098.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"諏訪部 順一","creatorId":"vndb:s66","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s66","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s66","name":"諏訪部 順一","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21364","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1268","characterName":"紺野 玉緒","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1268"},"originalCharacterName":"紺野 玉緒","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"119"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"181"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"65"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Student Council President, Konno is serious and straightforward when working at a task. He is extremely gentle, almost never gets mad, and gets surprised/flustered very easily. He is your upperclassman, and will leave in your 2nd year, though you will continue to date him while he's in college. Konno rides a bike to school, and likes it when you study hard and join student council."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Tokimeki Memorial Girl's Side Wiki"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the younger brother of Konno Tamami from the first game."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1268"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c234fc6ade9b854c97b73916729a4f63e38571d166daf529a5545de0467d56c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ac/ace3ddfa7d7ac695d9e82170c5e74d718218d35423d28ff4e3dc8acd539c0da0.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"千葉 進歩","creatorId":"vndb:s400","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s400","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s400","name":"千葉進歩","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21371","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1269","characterName":"新名 旬平","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1269"},"originalCharacterName":"新名 旬平","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1125"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"173"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Your kouhai, Junpei arrives in year 2, though you can meet him while shopping in year 1, while he's still in middle school. He joins Judo after being harassed into it by Arashi, and acts young and carefree and fawns over pretty upperclassmen you, almost like a little brother. Friendly; happy and optimistic, he gets along with people easily. Junpei always takes care of his appearance and follows the latest trends. He is good at both sports and studies."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From 26 Hours and Tokimeki Memorial Girl's Side Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1269"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a4178cdb41acb7573b75ffed94943bf68a8c834d5e363528110880af7e3ba1aa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/307e6104573699028fbdc5d64b9bcbdb80e37f12f90e1b1f2be08ee40418922d.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"私市 淳","creatorId":"vndb:s420","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s420","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s420","name":"私市 淳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:21372","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1270","characterName":"不二山 嵐","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1270"},"originalCharacterName":"不二山 嵐","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"908"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"177"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"70"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The sports baka of the game, Arashi is quieter than the usual sports baka. He likes to maintain a cool facade, but his passion shows through while doing Judo. He likes to help others (he's the lifeguard at the pool), and maintains an active lifestyle. He can be a little clueless sometimes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Tokimeki Memorial Girl's Side Wiki and 26 Hours"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1270"}],"profileFacts":[],"me